contentText:
Taylor Swift had a lot of fun toying around with her Toy Story 5 anthem, &#8220;I Knew It, I Knew You,&#8221; with the singer-songwriter revealing in a new behind-the-scenes clip on Instagram that she wrote, recorded and produced the track with collaborator Jack Antonoff in just eight hours.

